{"id":"xr4nzbp9c9qduhhosmbro166a","title":"YODAS v3 发布超过 1.1 million 小时、覆盖 100 多种语言的语音数据集","originalTitle":"espnet/yodas3","summary":"YODAS v3 发布了超过 1.1 million 小时、覆盖 100 多种语言的网页音频数据，可用于自动语音识别、文本转语音和音频表示学习。数据集包含 6,685 个约 8 GB 的 WebDataset 分片，约 75% 的音频带有转录，约 95% 的转录包含词级时间戳，并提供英文翻译、语言标识和音频带宽等元数据。","reason":"YODAS v3同时提供音频、转录、翻译和频谱元数据，并给出流式加载示例，便于评估其对多语言语音任务的数据支持能力。","source":{"name":"Hugging Face 数据集趋势"},"links":{"original":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/espnet/yodas3"},"publishedAt":"2026-06-19T04:31:02.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-10-12T15:51:40.029Z","timelineAt":"2026-06-19T04:31:02.000Z","category":"models-datasets","tags":["新项目","Hugging Face"],"score":95,"selected":true,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"hugging-face","name":"Hugging Face"},{"slug":"new-project","name":"新项目首发"}],"indexable":true,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}